  "findings": [
    {
      "criterion": "natural_arena_pressure",
      "fact": "Contract 33 leaves the exact mechanic, timing and escalation UNKNOWN. Accepted packaged pressure evidence invokes the authoritative API from fixtures. Native ApplyArenaPressure explicitly adds no elapsed-time escalation.",
      "decision": "Do not invent a timer or connect the service-bay switch to the arena-pressure API. The visual contract also accepts environment-consequence capture states: the implemented power switch, panel destruction and electrical-floor damage are now proven through ordinary input at 720p. Keep this environmental proof distinct from unqualified native arena_pressure timing and full encounter composition."
    },
    {
      "criterion": "continuous_600_1200_seconds",
      "fact": "Native objective success and player defeat terminate normal control. The latest current-package attempts reach Success at 46.3133 and 9.0215 active seconds. The earlier interaction attempt lasted 57.1384 seconds before rival-fire defeat; these short routes do not prove every possible input route ends immediately.",
      "decision": "Preserve accepted terminal behavior. A supported continuous content sequence is not yet established; restart stitching and idle padding remain prohibited.",
      "causal_evidence": "BiellaOpenWorldGameMode inherits SpawnDemoActors and the two-target Demo objective. BiellaDemoObjectiveManager excludes streaming infected. In hud-1080-01 telemetry the rival alone kills both tracked infected by 9.3066 s; Success follows at 9.4109 s even while streamed population survives. This identifies the early terminal cause without changing accepted behavior.",
      "additional_probe": {
