        "input_plan": "rival-intercept-input.json",
        "package": "preserved D08 Linux installed package; no native overlay",
        "active_simulation_seconds": 14.007807950431015,
        "terminal": "Success",
        "player_weapon_events": 3,
        "observed": "Normal sprint/fire input hits a streaming infected and the first objective infected, not the rival. Population infected then join the target set (target rises from 2 to 6 before success). Rival fire clears the remaining target set. This corrects any inference that all later population is excluded from objective counting; BiellaStreamingInfected and BiellaPopulationInfected have different registration behavior.",
