  "independent_work": "Authored editable tapered growth on fixed rail/column/header, distinct tissue/red-capillary materials and finer coated-metal detail; saved readback, fresh package and interaction fixture pass. Ordinary-input power/destruction/electrical-floor consequence now also passes at 720p. Direct raw inspection still finds sparse partly hidden growth and dry surrounding approach. Next smallest visual creation: expand attached growth across visible column/header faces, keeping interactables, panel motion and tested collision clear; then qualify the changed layer from the same ordinary camera.",
